{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-About_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1744241627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Milly\u2019s Meadow is a relaxing idle game that sits on your desktop - resize it and place it anywhere to create the perfect peaceful backdrop for your day. Enjoy the soothing sounds of nature, raking leaves and original Lo-Fi tunes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Millys_Meadow_Raking.gif?t=1744241627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Customise_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1744241627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and customise Milly's outfits to match your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Millys_Meadow_Customise.gif?t=1744241627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Decorate_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1744241627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and decorate Milly's meadow the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Millys_Meadow_Decorate.gif?t=1744241627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Work_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1744241627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Milly's Meadow sits on top (or behind) your applications while you work or unwind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: